# VPS self-host and panel access

When editing install/deploy files or fixing unreachable panels, read and follow the project skill:

**`.cursor/skills/vps-access/SKILL.md`**

Quick reference:

- **Three layers:** panel bind → host firewall (ufw) → cloud security group
- **HTTPS:** `scripts/deploy-https.sh` → `src/deploy/nginx_setup.py`
- **IP-only public URL:** nginx on port **80** → panel **8787**
- **Gateway operator policy:** `libs/agent_rules/vps-access.md` (keep in sync when behavior changes)

Do not name other hosting panel products in user-facing strings — see `crossborder-product.mdc`.
